Package: ruster
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, passwd
Maintainer: Ruster developers <ruster@example.invalid>
Description: packet forwarding daemon
 ruster is a Rust packet forwarding daemon for Linux AF_PACKET interfaces.
 It provides bounded packet processing with a systemd service integration.
